Note: EPL Algo Package — Usage Examples
Use "epl-algo"

Note: --- Sorting ---
Create data equal to [64, 34, 25, 12, 22, 11, 90]
Print "Original:"
Print data

Print "Merge sort:"
Print merge_sort(data)

Print "Quick sort:"
Print quick_sort(data)

Print "Heap sort:"
Print heap_sort(data)

Note: --- Searching ---
Create sorted_data equal to [2, 5, 8, 12, 16, 23, 38, 56, 72, 91]
Print "Binary search for 23:"
Print binary_search(sorted_data, 23)

Print "Insert point for 15:"
Print binary_search_insert_point(sorted_data, 15)

Note: --- Graph ---
Create g equal to create_graph()
Set g to add_vertex(g, "A")
Set g to add_vertex(g, "B")
Set g to add_vertex(g, "C")
Set g to add_vertex(g, "D")
Set g to add_edge(g, "A", "B", 4)
Set g to add_edge(g, "A", "C", 2)
Set g to add_edge(g, "B", "D", 3)
Set g to add_edge(g, "C", "B", 1)
Set g to add_edge(g, "C", "D", 5)

Print "BFS from A:"
Print bfs(g, "A")

Print "DFS from A:"
Print dfs(g, "A")

Print "Dijkstra A->D:"
Print dijkstra(g, "A", "D")

Note: --- Dynamic Programming ---
Print "LIS of [10,9,2,5,3,7,101,18]:"
Print longest_increasing_subsequence([10, 9, 2, 5, 3, 7, 101, 18])

Print "Coin change [1,5,10] for 27:"
Print coin_change([1, 5, 10], 27)

Print "Max subarray sum:"
Print max_subarray_sum([-2, 1, -3, 4, -1, 2, 1, -5, 4])
